  "student_passage": "### A\n\nLast Friday, I worked with a volunteer (1) ____ showed me around our school library. We carried two empty (2) ____ (shelf) into the reading room. One shelf was (3) ____ (wide) than the doorway, so we turned it sideways. We moved as (4) ____ (careful) as possible because the floor had just been cleaned. By lunchtime, there was space for the new books.\n\n### B\n\nOur class watched a short film about the night sky. It contained (5) ____ (many) pictures than words, but each picture was important. Before the film, our teacher asked us (6) ____ listen for the names of three planets. My friend became interested (7) ____ astronomy and borrowed a book afterwards. We plan to watch the next film together.\n\n### C\n\nOn Sunday I met a neighbour (8) ____ (carry) a heavy suitcase. She was the woman (9) ____ daughter had helped me find my lost cat. I offered to carry the case upstairs. She thanked me for (10) ____ (help) her. It only took a few minutes, but we both felt happier after our short conversation.",
