  "filled_passage": "### A\n\nLast Friday, I worked with a volunteer (1) who showed me around our school library. We carried two empty (2) shelves (shelf) into the reading room. One shelf was (3) wider (wide) than the doorway, so we turned it sideways. We moved as (4) carefully (careful) as possible because the floor had just been cleaned. By lunchtime, there was space for the new books.\n\n### B\n\nOur class watched a short film about the night sky. It contained (5) more (many) pictures than words, but each picture was important. Before the film, our teacher asked us (6) to listen for the names of three planets. My friend became interested (7) in astronomy and borrowed a book afterwards. We plan to watch the next film together.\n\n### C\n\nOn Sunday I met a neighbour (8) carrying (carry) a heavy suitcase. She was the woman (9) whose daughter had helped me find my lost cat. I offered to carry the case upstairs. She thanked me for (10) helping (help) her. It only took a few minutes, but we both felt happier after our short conversation.",
